{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37253","headline":"读五侯传 · 秦韬玉","name":"读五侯传","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉亡金镜道将衰，便有奸臣竞佐时。\n专国祗夸兄弟贵，举家谁念子孙危。\n後宫得宠人争附，前殿陈诚帝不疑。\n朱紫盈门自称贵，可嗟区宇尽疮痍。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"秦韬玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37253.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37253","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}